1. Data Backup, Restore & Multi-Device Sync (JSON / Cloud)
Abhi sara data browser ke localStorage mein rehta hai (agar browser cache clear ho to data khatam hone ka khatra hota hai).
Download Full JSON Backup aur Upload / Restore JSON Backup button.
Is se aap ek computer se doosre computer par pura data 2 seconds mein transfer kar sakte hain.

2. Employee Targets & Leaderboard (Gamification)
Har employee ke liye daily/weekly target (e.g. 500 units/day).
Visual progress bar: "Abdul Rehman: 450/500 Units (90% Target Achieved)".
Dashboard par "Top Performer of the Day / Week" badge.

3. Duplicate Detection & Error Prevention
Jab koi naya Reference ya Bulk Import kare:
Agar wahi Reference Number pehle se mojood ho to foran warning/badge dikhaye taake duplicate entry na ho.
Invalid ASIN format warning (Amazon standard 10-character alphanumeric check).